  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At the foot of Tian Ti, after months of elite-disciple ranking among Central Continent’s ten great sects, formless Gu Immortal consciousnesses discuss that generation’s juniors and credit Long Nǚ with teaching Myriad Dragon Dock’s Ying Sheng Ji well. After Feng Jin Huang enters the opened Hu Immortal Inheritance, Xiao Qi Xing, Ying Sheng Ji, and others follow in turn before many remaining disciples, including Fang Zheng.",
      "chapters": [
        365
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elite-disciple-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tian_ti",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_long_nu",
        "char_ying_sheng_ji",
        "char_feng_jin_huang",
        "inh_hu_immortal_inheritance",
        "char_fang_zheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another Gu Immortal watching the inheritance tells He Feng Yang he had great schemes, using this secret chess piece. He Feng Yang answers that among the youngsters, Myriad Dragon Dock has Ying Sheng Ji, Spirit Affinity House has Feng Jin Huang, and Spirit Butterfly Valley has Xiao Qi Xing, so Immortal Crane Sect cannot contend and thus had to do this.",
      "chapters": [
        375
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "secret-chess-piece-talk",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_feng_yang",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house",
        "loc_spirit_butterfly_valley",
        "char_xiao_qi_xing",
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Crane elders name Myriad Dragon Dock’s Song Zi Xing as having obtained one of the true blood sea inheritances and defected, becoming a rank seven Gu Immortal titled Blood Dragon. To kill him and wipe away the humiliation, Myriad Dragon Dock dispatched eight Gu Immortals, five rank six and three rank seven; he killed four, crippled three, and beat one into retreating.",
      "chapters": [
        407
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "song-zi-xing-betrayal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_zi_xing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After that pursuit Myriad Dragon Dock went into a downturn, its reputation even lower than Immortal Crane Sect, and became the worst among the ten great ancient sects until Vicious Lightning Fiend returned from closed cultivation and began to restore that status.",
      "chapters": [
        848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "song-zi-xing-betrayal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_vicious_lightning_fiend"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Fei He mountain, Gui Li warns that if Great Heavenly Sword Sect detaches from Immortal Crane Sect and joins Myriad Dragon Dock, Immortal Crane’s northwest control shrinks further, because Immortal Crane territory connects to Myriad Dragon Dock territory and the areas around Great Heavenly Sword Sect would combine into Myriad Dragon Dock’s sphere of influence.",
      "chapters": [
        697
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "territory-beside-immortal-crane",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_fei_he_mountain",
        "fac_great_heavenly_sword_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, Fairy Bai Qing moves toward Myriad Dragon Dock rather than flying straight to Falling Heavenly River, uses transportation Gu formations inside Myriad Dragon Dock’s force range after paying Myriad Dragon Dock Gu Immortals a high price, then steps from that territory into Combat Immortal Sect territory.",
      "chapters": [
        955
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "territory-beside-immortal-crane",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_bai_qing",
        "loc_falling_heavenly_river",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "fac_combat_immortal_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When a blue charm lightning shadow puppet is exposed inside Hu Immortal blessed land, Fang Yuan addresses it as Myriad Dragon Dock’s Vicious Lightning Fiend. Tai Bai Yun Sheng introduces him as a rank six Gu Immortal who once drew with a rank seven Gu Immortal and then entered years of closed cultivation. Vicious Lightning Fiend declares himself a Gu Immortal of Myriad Dragon Dock, and under pressure trades away the Blood Deity remnant recipe that only a small number of Myriad Dragon Dock Gu Immortals know he holds.",
      "chapters": [
        706
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "vicious-lightning-fiend-exposure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "rcp_blood_deity_immortal_gu_recipe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Vicious Lightning Fiend took years, using Myriad Dragon Dock resources, to create the immortal killer move lightning deity from that Blood Deity remnant recipe across lightning path and blood path.",
      "chapters": [
        1240
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "vicious-lightning-fiend-exposure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chen Zhen Chi is named Myriad Dragon Dock’s flying grandmaster under the Central Continent saying “Zhen Chi of the nine heavens.”",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "vicious-lightning-fiend-exposure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chen_zhen_chi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Central Continent tea talk also lists Myriad Dragon Dock’s dragon shadow tea beside Spirit Affinity House’s qingpu tea as very famous.",
      "chapters": [
        1093
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "vicious-lightning-fiend-exposure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
